# Fallback for `docker compose up -d` by hand — Komodo writes scanopy/.env itself from
# komodo/stacks/scanopy.toml (see CLAUDE.md's "Secrets via Komodo Variables").
# Docs: https://github.com/scanopy/scanopy

## Image versions are pinned in docker-compose.yml, not here — see CLAUDE.md.

SCANOPY_LOG_LEVEL=info

## CHANGE before deploying — generate with `openssl rand -base64 32`.
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=changeme

## LAN-only by decision (maps real network topology) — no cloudflared Public Hostname rule.
SCANOPY_PUBLIC_URL=http://lab53:60072
